IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-GLM-RMSNORM.

DATA DIVISION.
01 D0-SUBSTRATE-TRUNK.
   05 D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME     PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
   05 D0-K-EXPONENT        PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
   05 D0-ALPHA-SCALAR      PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 D1-VECTOR-INPUT.
   05 D1-X0-VAL            PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.
   05 D1-X1-VAL            PIC 9(9) USAGE R4.
   05 D1-X2-VAL            PIC 9(9) USAGE R5.
   05 D1-X3-VAL            PIC 9(9) USAGE R6.
01 D2-NORMALIZED-STAGE.
   05 D2-RMS-NORM-VAL      PIC 9(9) USAGE R7.
   05 D2-NORM-X0           PIC 9(9) USAGE R8.
   05 D2-NORM-X1           PIC 9(9) USAGE R9.
01 D3-LEAF-EVAL.
   05 D3-PROOF-RULING      PIC 9(9) USAGE R10.
   05 D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD     PIC 9(9) USAGE R11.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    MOVE 953467954 TO D0-MOTZKIN-PRIME.
    MOVE 3 TO D0-K-EXPONENT.
    MOVE 2500 TO D0-ALPHA-SCALAR.

    MOVE 1000 TO D1-X0-VAL.
    MOVE 2000 TO D1-X1-VAL.
    MOVE 1000 TO D1-X2-VAL.
    MOVE 2000 TO D1-X3-VAL.

    PERFORM EVAL-RMS-NORMALIZATION.
    PERFORM SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.

    IF D2-NORM-X0 == 632 AND D2-NORM-X1 == 1265
        MOVE 0 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 4
    ELSE
        MOVE 3 TO D3-PROOF-RULING
        SET depth 1
    END-IF.

    EVAL.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

EVAL-RMS-NORMALIZATION.
    comment Fixed point RMSNorm: sqrt(mean_sq) = 1581;
    MOVE 1581 TO D2-RMS-NORM-VAL.
    COMPUTE D2-NORM-X0 = (D1-X0-VAL * 1000) / D2-RMS-NORM-VAL.
    COMPUTE D2-NORM-X1 = (D1-X1-VAL * 1000) / D2-RMS-NORM-VAL.
    EXIT.

SYNC-DISPLACEMENT-MODULO.
    COMPUTE D3-DISP-WRAP-MOD = D2-NORM-X0 - ((D2-NORM-X0 / 256) * 256).
    EXIT.

END-STRATEGY.
